      "notes": "Purpose: Fetches last 10 messages for current user from Supabase\nTable: messages\nFilter: chat_id = current user\nOrder: created_at ASC (chronological for Groq context)\nLimit: 10\nAlways Output Data: ON (new users have no history)"
